  "body_html": "<p>Transform any bedroom into a vibrant haven for softball enthusiasts with this premium comforter set from Jeminise. Designed for girls, teens, and women who love softball, this bedding set brings a dynamic sports theme to your decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Celebrate your passion for softball with a design that resonates with players, fans, and lovers of the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Craftsmanship:</strong> Features an eco-friendly finishing process that ensures vibrant colors and prevents fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and breathable feel that is more durable than cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes a soft and comfortable comforter to complete your bedding ensemble.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a bright teal and yellow color palette with a vibrant softball design, perfect for adding a relaxing and wonderful mood to any room.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
